1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,300
Your chunker just cut "notwithstanding the
foregoing" off the rule it modifies.

2
00:00:06,317 --> 00:00:10,592
Fixed 512-token windows don't know
where a clause ends.

3
00:00:10,892 --> 00:00:13,067
The rule lands in one chunk.

4
00:00:13,683 --> 00:00:16,133
Its exception lands in the next.

5
00:00:16,433 --> 00:00:21,870
Retrieval finds the rule without the exception,
and the answer comes out confidently

6
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:22,258
wrong.

7
00:00:23,283 --> 00:00:28,817
So chunk by clause, along the contract's own
numbering, and split long clauses only

8
00:00:28,817 --> 00:00:30,883
at their sub-clause boundaries.

9
00:00:31,883 --> 00:00:37,075
The full chunking strategy, with context
headers and cross-references, is on

10
00:00:37,075 --> 00:00:37,758
vidyal.ai.
